          "transcript": [
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "hey whats up im just chilling after a long day at work how bout you"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "aw rough day huh? im just chilling on my balcony watching the rain, lowkey my fave way to unwind"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah was a grind at the warehouse what bout you got any pets or anything fun"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "yea ive got this rescue cat named Biscuit, hes always causing chaos but i love him fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha my cat whiskers is the same always knocking shit over whats biscuits fave spot to chill"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "lowkey makes my days more fun, especially when im just chilling like this"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah cats make everything better so whats his fave spot to nap"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "ahaha he loves the windowsill, stares out like hes plotting world domination"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha whiskers loves staring at birds out the window too whats biscuits fave toy or treat"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "whats the craziest thing whiskers has knocked over tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha he knocked over a lamp once shattered everywhere whats biscuits wildest stunt"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "ahaha that lamp shatter sounds chaotic, biscuits wildest was jumping off the top shelf and knocking down a whole plant, dirt everywhere fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "lmao dirt everywhere sounds like a nightmare has biscuit tried that jump again or nah whats ur job like anyway"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "his fave toy is this little feather wand, goes nuts for it"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha feather wands are the best has he tried that big jump again whats ur job like"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "smartened up lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha cool on the jump thing so whats ur job like anyway i work warehouse its meh"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "im on fanvue full time now, used to bartend but this is way better fr. whats a rough day at the warehouse like for u"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "eh rough days mean non stop lifting heavy crates back aches like crazy what was bartending like fun or nah"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "bartending was chaotic fr, drunk people yelling for shots all night but the tips could be fire on a good shift"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha tips mustve been worth it any super crazy drunk stories whats ur go to drink"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "those back aches from lifting sound brutal tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah back aches are the worst part haha so any crazy drunk stories from bartending"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "u got any tricks to deal with em or just tough it out"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "eh i stretch and pop ibuprofen sometimes helps any wild drunk stories from bartending haha"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "one night this dude proposed to me with a napkin ring lol, had to shut that down quick"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "lmao napkin ring proposal thats wild howd u shut him down did he take it well"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "go-to is gin tonic, keeps it simple fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha gin tonic sounds chill howd u shut down that napkin proposal guy"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "whats urs, somethin strong after those warehouse shifts?"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "mines usually just a cold beer after work nothin fancy so howd u shut down that proposal dude lol"
            }
          ],
