          "transcript": [
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "hey hows your day going? im just chilling after a long shift at work lol what about you"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "long shift sounds rough babe"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah it was lol warehouse stuff all day what do you do for fun"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "im just chilling with a coffee, watching the rain outside. lowkey relaxing fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "that sounds chill rainy days are the best for me too got a cat that hates em lol whats in your coffee"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "lowkey just listening to some sza or hanging with biscuit, my cat. yours hates rain too? thats funny"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah he bolts under the bed every time lol biscuit sounds cute what breed is he? im more into indie stuff"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "and coffee's just black iced, nothing fancy. sometimes oat milk if im feeling bougie"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah black iced is solid i do the same sometimes lol so biscuits breed? and whats your go-to indie band"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "whats your cats name btw"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "his name is whiskers lol dumb but fits him whats biscuits breed? and any indie recs"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "ahaha yeah mine just stares out the window like its the apocalypse"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "lol yeah apocalypse stare is hilarious whiskers hides whats biscuits breed tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "biscuits a rescue tabby mix, fluffy little menace. and indie stuff? lowkey same vibes sometimes"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "cool tabby mixes are the best vibes whiskers is a tabby too lol whats your fave sza song"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "whats your go-to indie track rn tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "right now its something by alt-j lol but you didnt say your fave sza track yet"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "lol i just said, hes a rescue tabby mix. fluffy terror who owns the place"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah lol i know about the cat but you skipped the sza question whats your fave track"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "whiskers hiding under the bed sounds like my kinda drama tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah lol total drama queen but seriously whats your fave sza song i asked a couple times"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "ahaha i didnt skip, lowkey snooze is my jam from sza. that whole album fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah snooze is fire that albums solid lol whats your go-to chill activity on rainy days"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "whats got u on that alt-j vibe rn tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "idk their stuff just hits different on rainy days lol like fitzpleasure or something what about your chill activity tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "yea fitzpleasure slaps, especially when its pouring outside"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah lol totally does so whats your fave rainy day chill thing you skipped that"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "for me, rainy days mean black iced coffee and balcony time, watching the storm roll in"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah balcony vibes sound relaxing i just veg out with netflix lol any wild storm stories"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "is it raining at your spot rn tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "nah its clear skies here kinda boring lol you getting a good storm"
            }
